Rule 1 (ndim is non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (each dimension size is non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (every dimension size is non-negative when rank > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 7 (first and last axes, when present, have defined non-negative sizes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 0) ∧ (if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) ≥ 0)
>>
Rule 8 (dtype index must be within supported range 0–11)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 0 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 11
>>
Rule 9 (last axis size is non-negative when present)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 10 (first axis size is non-negative when present)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 11 (min and max are ordered for non-empty real tensors)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if 0 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8 ∧ ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 then min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
>>
Rule 12 (scalar real tensor has equal min and max)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 ∧ 0 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8 then min(v_1) = max(v_1)
